---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Account Deletion">
  <h1>Account deletion</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>How to delete your account</h2>
    <p>You can request deletion of your Khepia account by contacting our support team.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/0000000000">Message support</a></li>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:khepia.pk@gmail.com">khepia.pk@gmail.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What happens when you delete</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your account will be deactivated</li>
      <li>Active transactions must be completed or resolved before deletion</li>
      <li>Personal information will be handled according to the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and applicable data retention requirements</li>
      <li>Transaction records may be retained as required by law</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Processing time</h2>
    <p>Account deletion requests are processed by the Khepia team. You will receive confirmation once your account has been deleted.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
